---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_timing: caller is legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_timing --> q_check_target: hasEnded AND refundPeriodExpired
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period still active
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_target --> q_transfer_pos: target address has no existing position
    q_check_target --> q_revert_exists: target already has position
    q_revert_exists --> [*]: revert PositionExists
    q_transfer_pos --> q_clear_old: copy position data to newAddress
    q_clear_old --> [*]: clear old position, emit PositionTransferred

    note right of q_transfer_pos
        INV-001: position transfer only after refund period expires
        INV-002: SAFT integrity maintained across transfer
        INV-003: target must not have existing position (no merge)
    end note
